{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"粘t-结构"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"粘 t-结构"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"term-recollement","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>设 $i\\colon Z\\to X$ 为闭子簇, $j\\colon U\\to X$ 为相补的开子簇, 那么\n$$\r\ni^*\\dashv (i_* = i_!) \\dashv i^! \\colon D_c^b(Z)\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&amp;\\leftarrow \\\\ &amp;\\rightarrow \\\\ &amp;\\leftarrow\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\nD_c^b (X)\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&amp;\\leftarrow \\\\ &amp;\\rightarrow \\\\ &amp;\\leftarrow\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\nD_c^b(U)\\colon j_!\\dashv (j^* = j^!)\\dashv j_*\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对于 $M\\in D_c^b(X)$ 有"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\ni_!i^! M \\to M \\to j_*j^* M\r\n$$</p>\n<p>这一构造也可写成"},{"Local":{"url":"松极限","text":"松极限"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nD_c^b(X) = \\operatorname{laxlim} [D_c^b(U) \\overset{i^*j_* [-1]}{\\longrightarrow} D_c^b(Z) ].\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}